  "premise_review": [
    "SelectedTwistGroup contains the exact Set (α ≃ α), identity membership, composition closure under f.trans g and inversion closure under f.symm. All fields and closure premises remain exact; no canonical Group/Subgroup instance is invented.",
    "Faithful is the actual equality-reflection predicate ∀ g h, R.ρ g = R.ρ h → g = h. SurjectiveOn is the actual selected-membership existential ∀ φ, φ ∈ T.Twist → ∃ g, R.ρ g = φ. Neither is an arbitrary bare named Prop field.",
    "ClassifiesSelectedTwists retains both complete proof-valued fields faithful : Faithful R and surjective_on : SurjectiveOn R T. No field is dropped or weakened; the classifying witness remains a supplied premise rather than a constructed certificate.",
    "Existence keeps the full Γ/α/one/mul/R/T/C/φ/hφ context and exact C.surjective_on φ hφ proof. Uniqueness keeps every Γ/α/one/mul/R/T/C/φ/g/h/hg/hh premise and exact C.faithful g h (by rw [hg, hh]) proof. It does not claim injectivity absent C or existence outside T.",
    "The full original MonodromyRepresentation provider was read: Γ has raw one/mul with map_one/map_mul into equivalences. No separate group axioms on Γ are supplied by this type, so the group-action/subgroup nodes describe the visible permutation/closure/classification shape editorially, not an inferred Γ group or full categorical action.",
    "The independent conceptual seam is selected permutation-family closure versus the actual function predicates and their conditional classification consequences. The latter imports only this same-version new closure component before all module-doc commands, and explicitly opens its exact GRWTSK namespace without an alias or body edit.",
    "All original imports and source notices are retained in each component. Exact open Folder restores the original relative Monodromy lookup. The original TorsionShellComparison provider was read completely but supplies no additional field or theorem used by these commands; no elliptic/torsion correspondence is inferred.",
    "No old/new representation provider is substituted. These are actual equality/existence proof terms under all original premises, not a proof that any particular arithmetic representation classifies twists. Source context rebinding remains uncompiled and unreplayed."
